  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDPG will contribute to the usaid pakistan country development strategy by strengthening locally-led interventions that promote more peaceful communities (USAID development objective 2). It also aligns with USAID&apos;s policy  by orienting activities around addressing political marginalization, weak governance, and fragile social cohesion.</narrative>
